 The DJ who runs it has such a great voice.", "id": 3, "time": "28000"}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm ready for my next task.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're going to set the table.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is Peter bringing flowers? They'll make the table look nice for the photos.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good idea.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll call and tell him. He's coming around 5, right? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uhm-hum.", "id": 4, "time": "46000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can ask for and offer help or advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future actions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express complex statements using words like <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you make promises to your family or friends?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you usually promise to do or not to do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I'll help you make dinner!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content":