}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Requesting and Offering Help by E-mail", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>When you ask someone for help or advice, it is important to be very polite. </p><p>Here are some common sentences and expressions that are considered polite.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Offering for Help</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Help</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Where do you need me next?</p><p>Should I put on some music?</p><p>I can do that!</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Can you cut up these yellow peppers that I've seeded?</p><p>Please make them thin, but not too thin.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Advice</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Offering Advice</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Should I use warm or cold water?</p><p>How wide should the slices be?</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Whichever is most comfortable for you.</p><p>You should curl back your fingers so you don't cut them.</p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future with <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, the Present Simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use three different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about  things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are scheduled, like programs, classes, buses or trains, you use the Present Simple tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Deciding Now</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'll do anything.</p><p>They'll make the table look nice for the photos.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Intentions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'm going to listen, learn and help!</p><p>You're going to rinse the rice gently, please.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Schedules</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>It comes on in the early evening right?</p><p>It starts again next weekend and plays from 1:00 to 3:00. </p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cut up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to divide into pieces", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Come over here and cut up these yellow peppers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you are preparing a meal with a friend.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to seed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take the seeds out of a vegetable or fruit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you seed the yellow peppers for me, please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "whichever", "type": "name"}, {"content": "your choice", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(pronoun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do whichever you think is easiest for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to curl back", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to roll into a tight space", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should curl back your fingers so you don't cut them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tune into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to set your radio or TV to catch a channel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tune into radio station KZ 2740 for great music all day long!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le18ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue between two people who are making a meal together.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "One person will ask for advice and the other person will give advice about cooking.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span> to express a complex idea.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue with someone.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about making a meal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for advice and offer help.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express complex ideas.", "type": "text"}]}]}